## 13. Final Schema Proposal Summary

| SQL Table | Source CSV | Rows | PK | Foreign Keys | Notes |
|-----------|-----------|------|-----|-------------|-------|
| `manufacturers` | manufacturer_clean.csv | 240 | `manufacturer_id` | — | Direct load |
| `dosage_forms` | dosage_form_clean.csv | 113 | `dosage_form_id` | — | Direct load |
| `drug_classes` | drug_class_clean.csv | 453 → ~421 | `drug_class_id` | — | Deduplicate names first |
| `indications` | indication_clean.csv | 2,043 | `indication_id` | — | Direct load |
| `generics` | generic_clean.csv | 1,711 | `generic_id` | `drug_class_id`, `indication_id` | Map name→ID; include _clean description cols |
| `medicines` | medicine_clean.csv | 21,714 | `brand_id` | `generic_id`, `manufacturer_id`, `dosage_form_id` | Map names→IDs |

### Constraint Recommendations

| Constraint | Priority |
|-----------|----------|
| PRIMARY KEY on all `*_id` columns | **Required** |
| FOREIGN KEY on `medicines.generic_id`, `manufacturer_id`, `dosage_form_id` | **Required** |
| FOREIGN KEY on `generics.drug_class_id`, `indication_id` | **Required** (nullable) |
| NOT NULL on entity name columns | **Required** |
| UNIQUE on entity name columns | **Recommended** |
| CHECK `price >= 0` | **Recommended** |
| CHECK `type IN ('allopathic', 'herbal')` | **Optional** |

See `reports/sql_schema_proposal.md` for the full proposal.


